Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:03.96,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,In an era in which the nations of \Nthe world were waging a fierce war
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:06.15,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,of information just out of sight,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:09.52,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,two countries were at odds with \Neach other: Ostania, in the east,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.52,0:00:11.01,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and Westalis, in the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:14.73,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,In order to keep an eye on the actions of \Na leading figure in Ostania's government
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.73,0:00:16.09,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,who was planning a war,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.09,0:00:19.70,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Westalis set Operation Strix in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:23.33,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The one tasked with this operation \Nis the skilled agent, Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.71,0:00:26.93,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The mission given to the master of \Ndisguise with a hundred faces was...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.93,0:00:29.26,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,to start a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.85,0:00:33.08,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The father, Loid Forger, is a psychiatrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:35.16,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,His true identity: a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:37.01,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Code name: Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.65,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The mother, Yor Forger, is a civil \Nservant who works at city hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.98,0:00:43.23,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Her true identity: an assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.10,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Code name: Thorn Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.63,0:00:48.05,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The daughter, Anya Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.05,0:00:51.32,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Her true identity: a telepath \Nwho can read people's minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.03,0:00:53.90,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The dog, Bond Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:57.72,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,His true identity: a canine seer \Nwho can see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.59,0:01:01.60,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,They created this pretend \Nfamily for their own benefit,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.60,0:01:06.00,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and their mission continues as they all \Nhide their identities from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.28,0:02:44.22,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(564,1)\an1\fscx55\pos(469,282)}Part of the Family
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:54.11,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Bond, we're going for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:57.36,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.74,0:02:59.61,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.99,0:03:02.49,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You wanna go, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.28,0:03:05.03,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:07.58,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Bhork!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.29,0:03:10.50,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya is busy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.71,0:03:12.50,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Difficulty level max.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:13.67,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:16.55,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Apparently, it's very popular \Nat school right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:22.51,main,Loid,0,0,0,,She's concentrating really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.51,0:03:25.14,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,If she's not coming today,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.14,0:03:27.81,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I guess we'll do some training \Nrather than go on a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:33.06,main,Loid,0,0,0,,All right. We're off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:36.40,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Have a nice time, Loid, Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:53.83,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:04.51,main,Loid,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.51,0:04:07.06,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Go after your target's arms or \Nlegs to render them powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.51,0:04:10.10,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Don't go after vital points that \Ncould cause fatal wounds, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:12.56,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Then I won't be able to get \Nany intel out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:16.81,main,Franky,0,0,0,,You bastard! Did you forget how \Nmuch I've taken care of you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.81,0:04:17.86,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.86,0:04:20.36,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Once you bite your target, \Nabsolutely do not let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:25.95,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's risky for you, and biting your target \Nmore makes a fatal wound more likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.24,0:04:31.04,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Maybe you're too nice, and barking \Nand biting don't really suit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.41,0:04:32.45,main,Franky,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.79,0:04:35.04,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Why am I playing the suspect, anyway?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:37.29,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Again, I'm an informant, and—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.29,0:04:39.59,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I need to train him. I have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.59,0:04:41.46,main,Franky,0,0,0,,How am I your only option?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:44.46,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Well?! Tell me! Tell me \Nin 500 characters or less!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.75,0:04:49.26,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Things are getting really fishy right now,\N so I need to prepare for the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:50.97,main,Franky,0,0,0,,That literally answered nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.97,0:04:54.56,main,Loid,0,0,0,,All right. That's enough suppression \Nand protection training.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:57.90,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let's do some training on order \Nsorting and locating explosives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:04:59.61,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's really hard to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:04.49,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Wait, am I supposed to participate? \NAm I supposed to be the bomber?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:09.50,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What's wrong? I guess you've \Nused up your concentration.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.74,0:05:14.46,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Project Apple is where they did experiments \Nto make intelligent army dogs, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:18.00,main,Franky,0,0,0,,He probably had to go through a lot of \Ntraining and doesn't want to do it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:20.09,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.25,0:05:26.00,flashback,Researcher,0,0,0,,You can't even do this? What a stupid mutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.34,0:05:28.26,flashback,Researcher,0,0,0,,I guess the project is a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:30.55,flashback,Researcher,0,0,0,,These mutts will probably be disposed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.02,0:05:39.10,main,Franky,0,0,0,,To the doggo here, training and \Ncombat are basically like playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.52,0:05:41.86,main,Franky,0,0,0,,At least try to act like you're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.86,0:05:44.53,main,Franky,0,0,0,,You're always lacking in that department.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:47.61,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Take him on a walk or something \Nfor a change of pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.61,0:05:49.74,main,Franky,0,0,0,,So yeah, I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:50.66,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.62,0:05:58.21,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Guess we can go for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.21,0:05:58.96,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.92,0:06:06.09,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Wow, you've made so many!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.09,0:06:08.05,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Those little stars are so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.47,0:06:12.64,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Tsk, tsk, tsk. They are no ordinary stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.64,0:06:18.31,main,Anya,0,0,0,,"Anya Holger! I present \Nyou with this Stella!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.19,0:06:22.06,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Ye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.83,0:06:36.62,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Don't eat stuff off the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:50.18,main,Child 1,0,0,0,,My ice cream! I barely got to eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:56.39,main,Child 2,0,0,0,,What a loser! From now on, \Nyour name's gonna be Icesplatio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.39,0:06:58.89,main,Child 1,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.32,0:07:11.03,main,Child 1,0,0,0,,Double-scoop ice cream! \NDouble-scoop ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.03,0:07:13.49,main,Child 2,0,0,0,,It's not fair that you get \Nmore allowance than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:14.87,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:20.25,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Ah, so you protected this \Nchild's food. Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.25,0:07:22.96,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It was definitely worth taking you in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:24.71,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.63,0:07:30.13,main,Child 1,0,0,0,,Whoa! What the heck's wrong with this bear?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.13,0:07:32.80,main,Child 1,0,0,0,,Is he after my ice cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.80,0:07:34.22,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Bond, stop! What's wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.39,0:07:45.15,main,Child 1,0,0,0,,My ice cream! I barely got to taste it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.15,0:07:47.82,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, lad! I'll buy you another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.98,0:07:54.70,main,Child 1,0,0,0,,Three scoops! Three scoops!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:55.95,main,Child 3,0,0,0,,No fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:57.25,main,Child 2,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:08:01.29,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's not like you to try to \Nget at someone else's food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.29,0:08:04.21,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you? Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.59,0:08:11.26,main,Elderly Man,0,0,0,,Hurgh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.97,0:08:16.77,main,Bicycle Guy,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! Are you all right?! \NSomeone call an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.15,0:08:29.52,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You're acting really weird today!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.78,0:08:35.78,main,Elderly Man,0,0,0,,What the heck is this beast?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.78,0:08:37.24,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.41,0:08:40.49,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I apologize for my dog's rudeness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.49,0:08:42.79,main,Elderly Man,0,0,0,,You clearly haven't trained him properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.29,0:08:47.00,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Biting an unknown civilian is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:49.13,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'll have to thoroughly retrain you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.55,0:08:53.84,main,Anya,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Bond! You saved the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:55.30,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:01.33,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.93,0:09:03.77,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.77,0:09:07.40,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I've done basic socialization and \Nobedience training with him already,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.40,0:09:10.83,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,and he's never been a reckless dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.19,0:09:14.82,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Just like with Anya, I guess I still \Nhave a lot to learn about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.57,0:09:20.78,main,Woman,0,0,0,,Oh, ew! A pigeon just pooped on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.57,0:09:21.31,sign_13319_178__But_then_John_r,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,250)\fnArial\fs16\fscx90\pos(141,224)}Precognition
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.31,0:09:26.39,sign_13319_178__But_then_John_r,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(292,793)\fnArial\fs16\fscx90\pos(141,224)}What he thinks \Nwill happen
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.41,0:09:25.00,main,Bond,0,0,0,,That's enough! Now we're \Ngonna get rid of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.21,0:09:31.34,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Is he sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.92,0:09:34.12,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Maybe I should take him to the vet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.18,0:09:40.51,main,Bennett,0,0,0,,Daisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.51,0:09:42.14,main,Firefighter,0,0,0,,Ma'am, you mustn't! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:43.89,main,Bennett,0,0,0,,But Daisy's still inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.89,0:09:45.89,main,Bennett,0,0,0,,No! Daisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.77,0:09:52.69,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:10:01.16,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,He's really on edge today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.16,0:10:05.83,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.54,0:10:07.83,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.30,0:10:18.34,main,Loid,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.22,0:10:24.39,main,Passersby,0,0,0,,Someone call the fire department!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:26.48,main,Passersby,0,0,0,,The fire's spreading faster than expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:30.81,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,A fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.81,0:10:32.98,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Was he reacting to the smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.82,0:10:37.36,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Is there anyone inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:39.74,main,Old Man,0,0,0,,Not to worry. Everyone made it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.37,0:10:43.45,main,Loid,0,0,0,,There have been a lot of these lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:46.04,main,Old Man,0,0,0,,I've heard rumors that it's actually arson.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.04,0:10:47.91,main,Passersby,0,0,0,,Where's that fire truck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.01,0:10:50.99,flashback,Bennett,0,0,0,,Daisy! Daisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.08,0:10:53.04,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.50,0:10:55.26,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You dummy, don't! There's no one inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.75,0:10:57.50,main,Old Man,0,0,0,,Don't you go in there, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.50,0:11:00.25,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Wait. Maybe he smells someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:08.43,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Bond! Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.48,0:11:11.40,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.02,0:11:17.77,main,Loid,0,0,0,,That's hot! What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.77,0:11:23.70,main,Loid,0,0,0,,A puppy... Does it live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.70,0:11:27.29,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You're ridiculous, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.45,0:11:30.12,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.12,0:11:31.21,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Can you run?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.79,0:11:33.17,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Keep as low to the ground as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.71,0:11:36.88,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Our way out...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.13,0:11:41.56,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,He's clearly scared of the fire. \NWe can't force our way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.93,0:11:44.01,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This is bad. What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.31,0:11:47.06,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Most of the bottom floor's \Nbeen engulfed in flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:50.32,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The only way out is the outdoor \Nstaircase north of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.32,0:11:52.77,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,There's a chance it might\N fall apart, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.77,0:11:53.82,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Bond, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.65,0:11:58.07,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?! \NThis is no time to play around!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.74,0:12:04.28,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Y-You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:09.70,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Your nose works even at times \Nlike this? You're really amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:13.58,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This means the outdoor \Nstaircase is a no-go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:18.38,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Which means we'll have to \Nforce our way through the smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.38,0:12:20.84,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'll be fine, but Bond's running out of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:24.59,main,Loid,0,0,0,,A plastic bag...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:30.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll take this and... take in \Nsome of the clean air down here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.14,0:12:33.48,main,Loid,0,0,0,,And we've got ourselves \Na makeshift oxygen tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.15,0:12:38.36,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We'll get through the places \Nwhere we can't breathe with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:39.61,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borforf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:46.87,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let's put her in here so we can carry her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.03,0:12:51.87,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Don't get lost. Make sure you follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.87,0:12:53.83,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.87,0:12:55.83,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.30,0:13:09.01,main,Old Man,0,0,0,,Hey! You made it out safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.64,0:13:13.81,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Apparently this little one \Nwas left in apartment 407.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.23,0:13:20.66,main,Old Man,0,0,0,,Hey! This is Ms. Bennett's puppy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.66,0:13:22.69,main,Old Man,0,0,0,,I guess she didn't get out in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.69,0:13:27.65,main,Old Man,0,0,0,,And he went in to save her? \NWhat an impressive dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.20,0:13:32.87,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Bond! You're on fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.75,0:13:36.91,main,Old Man,0,0,0,,Wait one sec! I'll bring a bucket of water!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.42,0:13:48.22,main,Old Man,0,0,0,,You're so skinny!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.68,0:13:51.45,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Is that... how you look when you're wet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.45,0:13:56.73,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I always have Yor bathe him, so this \Nis the first time I've seen this... It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:14:00.40,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,No, you mustn't, Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:01.94,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I am a cool-headed spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:04.07,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I cannot let my emotions show.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.69,0:14:07.93,main,Loid,0,0,0,,The fire's out. Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.49,0:14:12.03,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:16.46,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:18.92,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Sir, can you look after that puppy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:20.13,main,Old Man,0,0,0,,S-Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.13,0:14:21.45,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait a second, Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:30.72,main,Arsonist,0,0,0,,Holy crap! Just look at that epic blaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:32.97,main,Bennett,0,0,0,,Daisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.31,0:14:35.22,main,Firefighter,0,0,0,,Ma'am, you mustn't! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.22,0:14:36.99,main,Bennett,0,0,0,,But Daisy's still inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.77,0:14:41.15,main,Arsonist,0,0,0,,I could never give this shit up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.98,0:14:47.75,main,Arsonist,0,0,0,,Whoa! What the hell is \Nthat skinny, wet thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.24,0:14:55.74,top,Arsonist,0,0,0,,Ow! Let go of me, you dumb mutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.57,0:14:54.83,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,He managed to bite another civilian!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:14:57.71,main,Arsonist,0,0,0,,Why, you—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.62,0:15:00.24,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Oil and ignition tools?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.49,0:15:03.63,main,Arsonist,0,0,0,,Don't disrespect a human, you piece of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.97,0:15:10.18,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You knew he was the arsonist?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.93,0:15:17.14,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This is the same oil that the police \Nsaid was used in the other arson cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.81,0:15:21.40,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We'll just report him to the police \Nand let them deal with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.85,0:15:25.11,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you noticed. \NWas his scent at the scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.11,0:15:27.82,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Or was the arsonist letting \Noff his unique stress scent?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.78,0:15:32.45,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, either way, well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.45,0:15:35.08,main,Bennett,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness, Daisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:37.08,main,Bennett,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:41.96,main,Bennett,0,0,0,,I don't know what I would've \Ndone if I'd lost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:46.34,main,Bennett,0,0,0,,Oh, Daisy! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.68,0:15:56.97,main,Old Man,0,0,0,,This serious-looking guy and \Nthis huge, skinny dog saved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:58.94,main,Old Man,0,0,0,,They truly deserve an award.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.94,0:16:01.94,main,Old Man,0,0,0,,I'll go find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.23,0:16:07.94,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let's go. It wouldn't be good if \Neither of us ended up in the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.78,0:16:12.53,main,Lady with Mic,0,0,0,,And the bestest boy gets \Na year's worth of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:20.95,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You did well. I'm really impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.95,0:16:21.90,main,Loid,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:25.21,main,Imagination Loid,0,0,0,,I told you to bite their arm, not their leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.71,0:16:30.30,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:34.43,main,Loid,0,0,0,,There's someone waiting back home \Nwho would be sad if you died.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.73,0:16:51.24,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:54.65,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Putting you to work can take a back seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.95,0:16:58.83,main,Loid,0,0,0,,First and foremost, you need to fully \Nrealize that you're one of the Forgers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.28,0:17:00.41,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.20,0:17:02.54,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Are you hurt at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.16,0:17:06.33,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You probably inhaled a lot of smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.33,0:17:08.79,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Let's have you checked out just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.92,0:17:12.67,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.67,0:17:13.92,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:15.80,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Don't get ahead of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:20.18,main,Loid,0,0,0,,This is just because I can't afford to let any\Nmember of the Forger family be eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:30.23,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I don't have a mission tomorrow, so why don't\Nwe all go to a dog park? It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.23,0:17:33.78,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You're the only one who didn't get to enjoy \Nthe vacation since you stayed behind, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.99,0:17:38.32,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Why does your barking \Nchange when you're wet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.17,0:18:00.05,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The bright crimson that \Nappears right before my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:09.98,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stretches approximately 40,000 kilometers
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.11,0:18:17.82,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our wounds that inch closer behind us
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:22.91,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Make us wander even more \Nwhen we're already lost
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.91,0:18:27.50,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The unseeable, scentless, unmistakable future
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:29.42,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stabbed me in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.42,0:18:30.58,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:40.14,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Let me stay by your side tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:47.85,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Just for tonight, I'm going to be serious
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.14,0:18:51.73,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Come closer to me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.73,0:18:53.98,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Even the future we prayed for
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.98,0:18:56.03,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Has a different path
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.03,0:18:59.57,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,My dear
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.11,0:19:03.62,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our malice for each other
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.62,0:19:06.91,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Might just get to us
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.29,0:19:11.50,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Or maybe not
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.05,0:19:16.30,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:20.59,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Is it a knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.59,0:19:23.72,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? I-It's a penguin...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:25.97,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Origami is rather difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.27,0:19:28.73,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, I know. How about something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.90,0:19:36.48,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.74,0:19:40.00,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.28,0:19:45.74,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, dear. I guess I cut \Nthem up a bit too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.20,0:19:48.33,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.37,0:19:50.66,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.61,0:19:57.12,main,Anya,0,0,0,,B-Bond! You've shrunk \Ndown to almost nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.59,0:19:59.84,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, my. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.47,0:20:02.68,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You wouldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.68,0:20:05.22,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Someone accidentally sprayed \Nwater on him on our way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.43,0:20:08.93,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.10,0:20:12.14,main,Anya,0,0,0,,His voice is different, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.52,0:20:14.77,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It's all right, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.77,0:20:17.61,main,Yor,0,0,0,,This is what happens to \NBond when he gets wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.61,0:20:20.15,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Once he dries, he'll be back \Nto his usual fluffy self.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.53,0:20:27.37,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It's not like I can tell them that he rescued\N a puppy from a fire and caught an arsonist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.41,0:20:32.16,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa and Bond worked \Nextra hard on this walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.87,0:20:37.46,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Bond, just a moment. I'll dry you right off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.46,0:20:38.93,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.38,0:20:40.34,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.23,0:20:54.69,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa! Bond! I present you \Nboth with these Stellas!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.69,0:20:59.15,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What's this? Are you playing \Nwith pretend Stellas?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.73,0:21:03.94,main,Anya,0,0,0,,It's the "Worked Super \NHard on Your Walk" award.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.45,0:21:11.95,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Wow! Bond, Loid, congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.45,0:21:15.50,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This is fine and all, but could \Nyou get some real Stellas?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.50,0:21:16.83,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.75,0:21:21.38,main,Loid,0,0,0,,All right. Let's get dinner going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.38,0:21:22.84,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.84,0:21:25.63,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya wants to eat Papa's Hamburg steak!
